Section 58. A qualified member vacates office upon:
death;resignation;
being dismissed by the Council of Ministers;
being bankrupt;being an incompetent or quasi-incompetent person;
( 6) being imprisoned due to a final judgement to a term of imprisonment,
except for the offence committed through negligence or fora petty offence.

